  "updated": "2026-06-22",
  "editorialHtmlEn": "<p>Steam and the three console families lead PC / living-room spend; Tencent-level mobile giants sit in “more” because their web hubs differ.</p><p>Hot mix below merges public RSS when you run <code>npm run fetch-hub-news</code> — dedupe is best-effort, timestamps come from feeds, and headlines often stay English at the source.</p><p>Last reviewed: <strong>2026-06-22</strong>. Piracy indexes, keygens, and unofficial ROM hosts are never listed.</p><p><strong>Who this page is for:</strong> readers who already follow a few storefront blogs but want one scrollable strip of <em>first-party</em> headlines (patches, hardware, live-service notes) without opening five tabs. I use it as a Sunday catch-up rail, not a discovery feed for unknown APK sites. If a publisher ships a major client update, I expect to see it via Steam News or the console blogs first — mobile-only MMO portals stay in “more” so the top ten stays comparable to Western revenue tables.</p><p><strong>Editorial cross-link:</strong> first game-original on this hub: <a href=\"/articles/steam-charts-bestsellers-most-played.html\">Reading Steam Charts</a>; character look-dev in <a href=\"/articles/game-girl-elena-sea-wind-reference.html\">Elena · Sea-Wind</a>, <a href=\"/articles/game-girl-elena-palette-ritual-notes.html\">palette & ritual UI</a>, and <a href=\"/articles/games-hub-generative-art-workflow.html\">Games hub × generative art workflow</a>.</p>",
  "editorialHtmlZh": "<p>PC 与客厅支出仍是 Steam 加御三家打头；腾讯系手游体量也很大，但主站形态不同，放在「更多」里。</p><p>下方 Hot mix 在运行 <code>npm run fetch-hub-news</code> 时从公开 RSS 合并写入；去重为尽力而为，时间戳随 feed，标题多保留来源站英文。</p><p>最近核对：<strong>2026-06-22</strong>。盗版索引、破解与非官方 ROM 站点一律不收录。</p><p><strong>适合谁看：</strong>已经会逛几家商店官网，但想在一个横向列表里扫一遍<strong>第一方</strong>补丁、硬件与运营公告的人。我自己当「周日补课」用，不把它当成 APK 发现站。大版本更新我默认会先出现在 Steam 新闻或御三家博客里；纯手游 MMO 门户放在「更多」，好让前十行仍能和常见欧美营收表对照。</p><p><strong>原创交叉链：</strong>游戏 Hub 原创轮播首篇 <a href=\"/articles/steam-charts-bestsellers-most-played.html\">Steam Charts 怎么读</a>；角色设定见 <a href=\"/articles/game-girl-elena-sea-wind-reference.html\">艾琳娜 · 海风之诗</a>、<a href=\"/articles/game-girl-elena-palette-ritual-notes.html\">配色与仪式 UI</a>，工作流 <a href=\"/articles/games-hub-generative-art-workflow.html\">游戏 Hub × 生成式角色美术</a>。</p>",
